<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <p style="font-style: italic; color: var(--jisr-muted);">This document is provided as a starting point for the site's launch. We recommend having it reviewed by a legal professional for full GDPR compliance, particularly if the movement becomes a registered legal entity.</p>

      <h2>Who is responsible for your data?</h2>
      <p>The JISR - جسر movement, an independent and non-political movement, is responsible for processing the data collected through this site.</p>

      <h2>What data do we collect?</h2>
      <p>When you fill in the "Join us" form: your name, email, country of residence, field or profession, and the message you write.</p>
      <p>When you fill in the "Contact" form: your name, email, subject, and the message you write.</p>
      <p>We do not collect any other data without your knowledge: this site does not use tracking cookies or advertising analytics tools.</p>

      <h2>Why do we collect this data?</h2>
      <p>This information allows us to process your request to get involved with the movement, get back in touch with you, and respond to your questions or suggestions.</p>

      <h2>On what legal basis?</h2>
      <p>On the basis of your explicit consent, given by ticking the dedicated checkbox before submitting the form.</p>

      <h2>Who has access to this data?</h2>
      <p>Your data is accessible to JISR team members responsible for following up on applications and messages. It is transmitted and stored via Netlify, our technical hosting provider, which acts as a data processor.</p>

      <h2>How long do we keep your data?</h2>
      <p>We keep your data for as long as necessary to process your request, and for a maximum of 3 years from our last exchange, unless a legal obligation requires otherwise.</p>

      <h2>What are your rights?</h2>
      <p>Under the GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict, and object to the processing of your data, as well as a right to data portability. To exercise any of these rights, contact us via our <a href="/en/contact/">Contact page</a>, specifying your request.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>This policy may be updated from time to time. The date of the last update is shown below.</p>

      <p class="meta-line" style="margin-top: 24px;">Last updated: August 20, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
